    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers present to the market this large six bedroomed detached home, situated on a site of approx. 0.5 acres with a detached single-storey garage and double height.\r\n\r\nThis property provides an excellent opportunity for an owner to establish a large home just a short distance from Limerick City Centre.\r\n\r\nInternally, the ground floor boasts three living rooms, a study, large kitchen, utility room, guest W.C. and an ensuite bedroom.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are five double bedrooms, the main having an ensuite bathroom, followed by a main bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nLarge, bright entrance hall connecting to the living room, office and kitchen.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nLarge open plan dual aspect kitchen / dining room with access to utility room.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nHardwood flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nDual aspect living room with double doored access to side.\r\n\r\nUtility\r\nAccess to side\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nW.C., W.H.B.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nDouble bedroom and en-suite.\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nDouble bedroom.\r\nBedroom 4 \r\nDouble bedroom.\r\nBedroom 5 \r\nDouble bedroom.\r\nBedroom 6\r\nDouble bedroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large Site\r\nExcellent Location\r\nOil Fired Central Heating"
      },
      {
